<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Refining 1996 year profit due Feb 27.</title>
<headline>NZ Refining 1996 year profit due Feb 27.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Refining Co Ltd said on Thursday it would report its result for calendar 1996 on February 27. -- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
